        },
        {
          "text": " Naarai arai kililini ijo cut kapak kana, enyouni do aiŋarakin ka aitajar naka Iyudayan kamaee, konye imudiario jo ka ekek loka papakon: ido iŋai bo nat ejeŋi ebe elemuni ibu ijo toma ajakanut kanuka apakio nuikote kwape nu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.14",
